    "按住两秒可清空托盘。通过键盘或 VoiceOver 激活后，需在确认窗口中再次确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold for two seconds to clear the tray. When using the keyboard or VoiceOver, confirm again in the dialog."
          }
        }
      }
    },
