    "Cicada 是一款 macOS 安全防护工具，通过监控合盖、断网、断电等触发器，在异常发生时启动警戒并推送通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cicada is a macOS security tool that monitors lid close, network loss, and power loss triggers, starting an alert and sending notifications when anomalies occur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可用触发器": {
      "localizations": {
